{"data":{"body":"[P2] Continue releasing deadlines while paused\n\nWith a paused `skipTime` execution containing two waits at different deadlines, this callback runs after the first completion. However, `invokeHandler()` returns from its paused branch before reaching the `finally` that releases the next deadline. The later wait remains pending indefinitely, so awaiting its `waitForData(COMPLETED)` before resuming hangs. Continue draining timed completions while holding back invocations, and add a pause/resume regression with multiple pending waits.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs7_v9Y5","finding_digest":"361a154198f21f569b01de0dd5d94b649168973d9df10b72fdeddf24fba98f03","finding_id":"arf_v1_gynbkqmy6ipvngyb3yg5lwklms","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-testing/src/test-runner/local/test-execution-orchestrator.ts::releasetimedcompletions::paused-deadline-progress","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-testing/src/test-runner/local/test-execution-orchestrator.ts::releasetimedcompletions::paused-deadline-progress","line":857,"observation_digest":"5fa5b43f0dd0fc7c14fd686b4a5c191e7ffd0ff605b45d7a24e5ceaedd715053","observation_id":"aro_v1_l6s3ipyn2d6hyfh5nbvuuxazdz","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-testing/src/test-runner/local/test-execution-orchestrator.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_gynbkqmy6ipvngyb3yg5lwklms","published_at":"2026-10-16T03:53:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_mwos3ugwezi2emge6nz65zumig","reviewed_base_sha":"911b7f0eee6d6322d47a0b4716b758555d404b15","reviewed_head_sha":"1e5ec7610c01d7b19c49d1e359eaea16a185225c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":855,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":1012},"record_id":"art_v1_7nax3mirfmpnuv3sl72232pjxb","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-16T03:53:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
